      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DUSTY MCGRAW (1) is a well performed dog who recorded his 17th career win last time out at this track (17.70). Goes very well from this draw with six wins and four minor placings from 11 starts. The one to beat again. TULSI BANNER (5) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 2.5 lengths at this track in a handy 25.37 beating DANNY WHIZZ BANG. Boasts a strong record from this draw with four wins and two minor placings from seven starts. Looks a key chance if runs up to latest figure. DANNY WHIZZ BANG (2) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing second behind TULSI BANNER (25.56) in a Mix 1/2/3. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from four attempts. Expected to feature. SPRING FRED (7) found the frame here last start and looks a top-three hope again.",
